{"compile_error":"cannot use `i32` where `Value` is expected: only a literal converts implicitly; write `Value::from(…)`","compile_errors_contains":["cannot use `String` where `Value` is expected","cannot use `i32` where `i64` is expected: only a literal converts implicitly; write `i64::from(…)`"]}
